[en.SP_ELEC_ENGINE]
Electric Generator Prototype

[en.SP_ELEC_ENGINE_desc]
If you have also been wondering about how the Storm Empire became so powerful, then you are not alone. Our researchers have been studying the technology of the Storm Empire for years, while none of us have truly understood how they managed to harness the power of the storm and lightning. However, luckily, we are now replicating their success on a... slightly (whispered)... smaller scale.
Instead of magic, the foundamental principle of the electric generator lies in electromagnetism, which is another branch of the mysterious magic of the universe. Instead of dancing, singing, and rotating with your friends in friendship field, you can now generate energy by rotating a coil in a magnetic field. Isn’t that amazing?

[zh.SP_ELEC_ENGINE]
发电机原型

[zh.SP_ELEC_ENGINE_desc]
如果你也一直在思考风暴帝国是如何变得如此强大，那么你并不孤单。我们的研究员们多年来一直在研究风暴帝国的技术，然而我们从未真正理解他们是如何成功地利用风暴和闪电的力量的。不过，幸运的是，我们现在正在复制他们的成功，只是在... 稍微（低声）... 小一点的规模上。
电力发电机的基本原理不是魔法，而是电磁学：这是宇宙中神秘魔法的另一个分支。以前你在友谊场中与朋友跳舞、唱歌和旋转，现在你将线圈在磁场中旋转来产生能量。这不是很神奇吗？
